        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "因此，方程组（1）有两个解：$(-8,6)$和$(6,-8)$.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 41,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0048#6"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "现在我们不用图解法来解同一个方程组.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 41,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0048#7"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "在第二个方程中，用变量$y$表示变量$x$后，得到：$x=-2-y$.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 41,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0048#8"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "把表示式$-2-y$代入第一个方程替换变量$x$：$\\begin{cases}(-2-y)^2+y^2=100,\\\\x=-2-y.\\end{cases}$",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 42,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0049#1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "由方程$(-2-y)^2+y^2=100$求得$y=-8$或$y=6$.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 42,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0049#2"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "因此方程组（1）和下列命题等价：$\\begin{cases}x=-2-y,\\\\y=-8\\end{cases}$或$\\begin{cases}x=-2-y,\\\\y=6.\\end{cases}$",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 42,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0049#3"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "由此得$\\begin{cases}x=6,\\\\y=-8\\end{cases}$。或$\\begin{cases}x=-8,\\\\y=6.\\end{cases}$",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 42,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0049#4"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "答：$\\{(6,-8),(-8,6)\\}$.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 42,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0049#5"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "我们所采用的这个解方程组的方法叫做代入消元法. 利用这个方法可以解两个二元方程的任何方程组，其中一个方程是二次方程，另一个方程是一次方程.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 42,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0049#6"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "例2　解方程组$\\begin{cases}x^2-3xy-2y^2+5x-7y+10=0,\\\\x+2y=1.\\end{cases}$",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 42,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0049#7"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "利用图解法解这个方程组很困难，因为我们不知道方程组的第一个方程的图象是怎样的. 而利用代入消元法解这个方程组就很简单.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 42,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0049#8"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "在一次方程$x+2y=1$中，用$y$表示变量$x$并把表示式$1-2y$代入方程组的第一个方程替换$x$后，得到和原方程组同解的方程组：$\\begin{cases}(1-2y)^2-3(1-2y)y-2y^2+5(1-2y)-7y+10=0,\\\\x=1-2y.\\end{cases}$",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 42,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0049#9",
            "p0050#1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "化简第一个方程后，方程组具有下列形式：$\\begin{cases}y^2-3y+2=0,\\\\x=1-2y.\\end{cases}$",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 43,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0050#2"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "由二次方程$y^2-3y+2=0$得出$y=1$或$y=2$.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 43,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0050#3"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "因此，$\\begin{cases}y=1,\\\\x=1-2y\\end{cases}$　或　$\\begin{cases}y=2,\\\\x=1-2y.\\end{cases}$",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 43,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0050#4"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "于是，$\\begin{cases}x=-1,\\\\y=1\\end{cases}$　或　$\\begin{cases}x=-3,\\\\y=2.\\end{cases}$",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 43,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0050#5"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "答：$\\{(-1,1),(-3,2)\\}$.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 43,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0050#6"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "代入消元法和图解法、加减消元法一样，也可以用来解二元线性方程组.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 43,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0050#7"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "如果方程组是由两个二次方程组成的，那么只有在特殊情况下，才能给出它的简单解法.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 43,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0050#8"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "我们来看例子.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 43,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0050#9"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "解方程组$\\begin{cases}x^2-3y^2=22,\\\\xy=21.\\end{cases}$",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 43,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0050#10"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "在方程组的第二个方程中，用$y$表示变量$x$并将所得到的式子代入第一个方程，得到方程组$\\begin{cases}x^2-3\\cdot\\left(\\frac{21}{x}\\right)^2=22,\\\\y=\\frac{21}{x}.\\end{cases}$",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 43,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0050#11"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "解第一个方程，得到$x=-7$或$x=7$. 再由方程$y=\\frac{21}{x}$求出对应的$y$值.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 44,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0051#1"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "如果$x=-7$，那么$y=-3$；如果$x=7$，那么$y=3$.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 44,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0051#2"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "p",
          "text": "答：$\\{(-7,-3),(7,3)\\}$.",
          "id": null,
          "label": null,
          "printed_page": 44,
          "source_refs": [
            "p0051#3"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  "section_breaks": [],
  "errata": []
}
